                        1090 --393: *                ER_MH_MYDATA_MEM_DEST          : Error in data storage address
                        1091 --394: *                ER_MH_MYDATA_SYS               : Abnormality of flash operation
                        1092 --395: *                ER_MH_MYDATA_SYS_CRITICAL      : FACI abnormality
                        1093 --396: *                ER_MH_MYDATA_PROG              : Flash write error
